<title>ITALY: CYCLING-MISSAGLIA WINS 11TH STAGE OF GIRO.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-MISSAGLIA WINS 11TH STAGE OF GIRO.</headline>
<dateline>CAMAIORE, Italy 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian Gabriele Missaglia won the 159-km 11th stage of the Giro d'Italia on Wednesday, according to provisional results.  </p>
<p>Andrea Vatteroni of Italy was second and compatriot Mirko Celestino third, according to the provisional results.</p>
<p>Russia's Pavel Tonkov retained the overall race leader's pink jersey.</p>
